.\r\n- On the merged player view complex advancements now actually track the player with the most criteria.\r\n\r\nI also made a quick video talking about the new coop features [here](https://youtu.be/qBglJWOdhGk).\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}